  "reason": "Existing evidence shows that multimodal, multiprofile models with scgpt RNA and imagenet_vit_l image encoder (config_022) achieve the highest accuracy. This experiment tests whether switching the RNA encoder to scvi_n200 while keeping the image encoder as resnet50 (a simpler alternative to imagenet_vit_l) and using avgpool aggregation/weighted fusion could yield comparable or better performance. This isolates the impact of RNA encoder choice, a critical design decision, while minimizing changes to other components."
